<urn:atm:triage:finding/CI-IDENT-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "CI-IDENT-001" ;
  triage:title "identities lint RULE-008/009 violation: 17 literal \"team-lead\" strings in herdr_nudge_invariant.rs" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr BA3-QA2-1789189465, PR #1402, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1402#issuecomment-5643745166. crates/atm-http-runtime/tests/herdr_nudge_invariant.rs contains 17 literal occurrences of the string \"team-lead\", violating identities lint RULE-008/009 (agent identity strings must come from the roster/const registry, not be hand-typed literals). Found on frozen feature/ba3-nudge-invariant@c462c6977 and cipher layer fix/phase-ba-cleanup@b9f7c4386. fenix ruling: BLOCKING for top open layer, promote to fix/phase-ba-merge-fix (solar)." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "lint" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "file_only" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T05:27:38Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "team-lead addendum (2026-09-12T05:41:00Z): verified all 17 literals are identical, line-for-line, on fix/phase-ba-cleanup@b9f7c4386 (same file); added as occurrences cleanup-1..17. feature/ba3-nudge-invariant occurrences are informational only (frozen, no fix there per Rand's rule). promote_to_branch = fix/phase-ba-merge-fix (solar) per fenix's ruling." ;
  triage:deferredNote "solar (task BA-MERGE-FIX-1789190857, ATM 01M2A275B1ZFZFH81EXWGJ4X9F, 2026-09-12T05:42:35Z): fix pushed to fix/phase-ba-merge-fix @ c571ae930. team-lead verified via git show: grep -c '\"team-lead\"' on herdr_nudge_invariant.rs at c571ae930 returns 0 (was 17). All ten required gates and three focused suites PASS per solar." ;
  triage:deferredNote "fenix ACCEPTED (ATM 01M2A2P74PQK7E3TM65K5ZAZQB, 2026-09-12T05:50:48Z): ten-gate run green, 23/23 nudge-invariant; BA-MERGE-FIX-1789190857 closed; layer frozen at c571ae930. FIXED." ;
  triage:promoteTo "fix/phase-ba-merge-fix" ;
